From: NOVA Delivery <nova-delivery@localhost>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 17:30:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Verify the v15 delivery and make the package prove itself
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The eighth upload (FastAPI-v15, 5ee0295) arrived with the project inside a Final/
wrapper -- the workspace folder was uploaded instead of the repository -- so
GitHub discovered *zero workflows* and ran zero jobs. Measured directly against
the REST API, with the previous repository as the control: same workflow file,
correct depth, 1 active workflow and 3/3 green jobs. The layout was repaired with
tools/restructure_repo.sh in the previous commit.

This commit closes the rest:

* The previous session's release step had never run: its commit aborted on
  "Author identity unknown", so the tree still carried the v14 package. All three
  delivery checks failed on arrival -- the layout guard, sha256sum -c (the zip is
  gitignored and never travels), and git am (the history was squashed again, so
  24dc3e6, bbfa863 and fd73e5a no longer exist). The identity is now configured.

* tools/verify_delivery.sh: a package is not a delivery until it has been applied.
  It checks the sums, applies the patch to a throwaway clone of the baseline and
  compares every source file, extracts the zip and runs the layout guard on its
  contents -- and confirms the guard *rejects* the same zip uploaded as a folder.
  Its output is deterministic (temporary paths normalised, tree hash instead of
  commit id) so it can be committed as evidence without dirtying the tree.

* make_release.sh excludes releases/delivery-roundtrip.log as well: the log is
  about this package, so packaging it would be circular.

* The Arabic handover note left the tree. It was swept in by the workspace upload,
  and test_english_content.py scans every text file in the repository -- an Arabic
  document at the root fails the language gate. It is delivered beside the repo.

* Documents now name FastAPI-v15 / 5ee0295 (PROJECT_STATUS.md 9.9 and 13,
  MIGRATION.md 12, releases/README.md, verification/README.md, README.md).
  Earlier sections stay as history.

Re-verified from scratch on the repaired tree (new clone, new virtualenv, same
library versions): 10/10 gates · 451 tests · 94% coverage · 15/15 missions ·
93 actions / 0 mistakes · readiness 100 (S) · 67/67 operations audited for player
text in-process and over a real socket · 12 offline + 14 live probes · 0 failures
(NASA POWER live, delta-mean 0.8858 C) · preview smoke green.

Evidence: verification/2026-11-12-v15/ (13 files, including the GitHub Actions
measurement and its control).
